# OksaSDR tour, "On the air": each mode heard as it is, iPad landscape 1366x1024.
# A template: make-modes.py fills 14.252 20 m SSB at 14.252 MHz: a DX station, spotted on the DX cluster as JY4CI in Jordan. 14.0280 CW on 20 m: callers in a pileup for C8K, Mozambique, as they sound; the decoder copies them. 7.177 40 m, 7.177 MHz: the FreeDV Reporter list shows RADE stations on the air; their voice comes through the app.
# from the spots of the moment (the DX cluster, FreeDV Reporter). Receive only; RADE on makes the
# slice the TX slice for a while (no transmission). Put back on 14.074 DIGU at the end.
pin 5
record 15
caption !speed 3
caption # On the air
caption Each mode as it sounds on the band right now, live from the radio.
ready
wait 4000
caption !speed 1
caption SSB: tap the frequency and type it.
caption !mark 240,145
frequency-dialog
wait 1500
keys 14.252
wait 1500
keys <Enter>
wait 1500
span 10
wait 1000
taptext DIGU
wait 2000
taptext USB ~442,159
wait 2500
caption 20 m SSB at 14.252 MHz: a DX station, spotted on the DX cluster as JY4CI in Jordan.
wait 20000
caption CW: the CW section shows the decoder's text as it copies.
taptext CW ~1263,82
taptext View ~1324,82
freq 14.0280
span 6
wait 1000
taptext USB
wait 2000
taptext CW ~510,159
wait 3000
caption CW on 20 m: callers in a pileup for C8K, Mozambique, as they sound; the decoder copies them.
wait 22000
taptext FreeDV ~1263,141
taptext CW ~1263,82
caption FreeDV: RADE digital voice, decoded in the app.
freq 7.177
mode DIGU
span 10
wait 2500
tapname radeButton
wait 3000
caption 40 m, 7.177 MHz: the FreeDV Reporter list shows RADE stations on the air; their voice comes through the app.
wait 30000
tapname radeButton
wait 3000
taptext View ~1324,82
taptext FreeDV ~1263,141
caption -
record off
freq 14.074
mode DIGU
wait 2000
slices
